   "textLength": 490,
   "text": "When the nation waits for results, who do you trust?\nFor 177 years, AP has been the steady voice America turns to on election night. Our reporters, election analysts and graphics journalists simply tell you who won — no spin, no bias, just facts. We're not owned by billionaires. We don't have an editorial agenda. We just count votes and report results, the same way we've done since 1848.\nDemocracy",
